fw": false, "body": "リクエストを再開されたのでリクエストお願いします！\n\n・キャラはボーイッシュのショートヘアーちゃん(https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/81294233)\n・カラーイラスト\n・衣装はこちらの眼帯ビキニで色は白(https://pbs.twimg.com/media/DITbwriVoAAxkzh?format=jpg&name=large)\n・背景は無地\n・表情は笑っているような感じ\n・ポージングはお任せいたします\n\n以上がリクエスト内容になります、何卒よろしくお願いします！！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yazirou/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b9a757f6/uploads/origins/5ac81cef-92e6-4996-bcf2-9c37066e8d63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=26216890edc9289e876ea2f67eaf83f0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b9a757f6/uploads/origins/5ac81cef-92e6-4996-bcf2-9c37066e8d63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=26216890edc9289e876ea2f67eaf83f0, https://si.imgix.net/b9a757f6/uploads/origins/5ac81cef-92e6-4996-bcf2-9c37066e8d63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a783cf454921baa7bacf4eb75d89f4ed 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b9a757f6/uploads/origins/5ac81cef-92e6-4996-bcf2-9c37066e8d63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=86a51cb453bcc6cecce5b40fb69915a4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yazirou/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a9c9771d/uploads/origins/c2b726d4-130d-45b1-85a7-67ae4d2b4a05?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6711a1b2ea27c29c4d985b77da6ba59", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a9c9771d/uploads/origins/c2b726d4-130d-45b1-85a7-67ae4d2b4a05?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Cco